#: ../../how-to/sampling.md:1
msgid "操作指南：生成或导入采样区域"
msgstr "How-to: Generate or import a sampling region"

#: ../../how-to/sampling.md:3
msgid "采样区域决定环境在哪些点上评估残差场。先想清楚物理边界、间距和框架，再打开向导或写构建定义。"
msgstr "The sampling region decides at which points the environment evaluates the residual field. Decide the physical boundary, spacing, and frame first, then open the wizard or write a build definition."

#: ../../how-to/sampling.md:5
msgid "生成式区域"
msgstr "Generated regions"

#: ../../how-to/sampling.md:7
msgid "构建定义支持四种生成式区域，全部使用规范 SI 单位（米）："
msgstr "The build definition supports four generated regions, all in canonical SI units (metres):"

#: ../../how-to/sampling.md
msgid "类型"
msgstr "Type"

#: ../../how-to/sampling.md
msgid "关键字段"
msgstr "Key fields"

#: ../../how-to/sampling.md
msgid "说明"
msgstr "Description"

#: ../../how-to/sampling.md
msgid "`box_cartesian`"
msgstr "`box_cartesian`"

#: ../../how-to/sampling.md
msgid "`minimum_m`、`maximum_m`、`spacing_m`"
msgstr "`minimum_m`、`maximum_m`、`spacing_m`"

#: ../../how-to/sampling.md
msgid "笛卡尔网格体"
msgstr "Cartesian volume grid"

#: ../../how-to/sampling.md
msgid "`cylinder_cartesian`"
msgstr "`cylinder_cartesian`"

#: ../../how-to/sampling.md
msgid "`radius_m`、`height_m`、`spacing_m`、`axis`、`center_m`"
msgstr "`radius_m`、`height_m`、`spacing_m`、`axis`、`center_m`"

#: ../../how-to/sampling.md
msgid "沿 x/y/z 轴的圆柱网格"
msgstr "Cylinder grid along the x/y/z axis"

#: ../../how-to/sampling.md
msgid "`sphere_cartesian`"
msgstr "`sphere_cartesian`"

#: ../../how-to/sampling.md
msgid "`radius_m`、`spacing_m`、`center_m`"
msgstr "`radius_m`、`spacing_m`、`center_m`"

#: ../../how-to/sampling.md
msgid "球体内部网格"
msgstr "Grid inside a sphere"

#: ../../how-to/sampling.md
msgid "`sphere_surface`"
msgstr "`sphere_surface`"

#: ../../how-to/sampling.md
msgid "`radius_m`、`point_count`、`center_m`"
msgstr "`radius_m`、`point_count`、`center_m`"

#: ../../how-to/sampling.md
msgid "球面上的采样点（至少 4 个点）"
msgstr "Points on a sphere surface (at least 4)"

#: ../../how-to/sampling.md:16
msgid "所有生成式区域都有 `frame` 字段（默认 `body`）。`spacing_m` 决定网格间距；`sphere_surface` 用点数而不是间距。"
msgstr "All generated regions carry a `frame` field (default `body`). `spacing_m` sets the grid spacing; `sphere_surface` uses a point count instead of spacing."

#: ../../how-to/sampling.md:18
msgid "导入式区域"
msgstr "Imported regions"

#: ../../how-to/sampling.md:27
msgid "支持 CSV、HDF5 和 VTK 族点集。CSV 头部必须是 `point_id,x_m,y_m,z_m,weight`；HDF5 和 VTK 的布局见[参考：格式契约](../reference/format-contracts)。"
msgstr "CSV, HDF5, and VTK-family point sets are supported. The CSV header must be `point_id,x_m,y_m,z_m,weight`; HDF5 and VTK layouts are in [Reference: format contracts](../reference/format-contracts)."

#: ../../how-to/sampling.md:29
msgid "进入下一步前的审查清单"
msgstr "Review checklist before moving on"

#: ../../how-to/sampling.md:31
msgid "**点数**：与你的评估预算和有限元网格一致。"
msgstr "**Point count**: matches your evaluation budget and the finite-element mesh."

#: ../../how-to/sampling.md:32
msgid "**范围**：覆盖目标控制区域，没有意外的缺口或越界点。"
msgstr "**Extent**: covers the target control region without unexpected gaps or out-of-bounds points."

#: ../../how-to/sampling.md:33
msgid "**框架**：字符串拼写与后续响应、外场声明完全一致。"
msgstr "**Frame**: spelling matches the later response and external-field declarations exactly."

#: ../../how-to/sampling.md:34
msgid "**顺序**：点 ID 顺序会被固化；之后所有通道文件都按这个顺序对齐。"
msgstr "**Order**: the point ID order is frozen; every later channel file aligns to it."

#: ../../how-to/sampling.md:35
msgid "**权重**：权重为正；均匀评估时全部取 1。"
msgstr "**Weights**: positive; use 1 everywhere for uniform evaluation."

#: ../../how-to/sampling.md:37
msgid "审查发现问题就回到源头修正，不要在响应文件里单独重排。"
msgstr "If review finds a problem, fix it at the source; never reorder a single response file on its own."
